sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant A as UA
participant B as DV / LC
participant C as OD
participant E as AD
rect rgba(75, 75, 75,.4)
    Note over B,C: See DV#8594;OD
    A->>B:
    B-->>A:
    A->>C:
end
C-->>A: LogoutRequest!
A->>E: LogoutRequest
E->>E: terminate SSO session
E-->>A: LogoutResponse
A->>C: LogoutResponse
rect rgba(75, 75, 75, .4)
rect rgba(75, 75, 75, .4)
    Note over B,C: See DV#8594;OD
    C-->>A:
    A->>B:
end
end
